      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. he's just a bit more wheezy than usual, it's not like he can't breathe, he's just struggling. if i give him a larger dose of the inhaler right now, won't that just fix it faster so we can just sleep it off? i really think he just needs more medicine to get through the night.",
